 </span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-ID\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">17 – 28 January 2022 - Starts at 09.00 AM (GMT +7, Surabaya Zone Time).</span><span lang=\"EN-ID\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"> </span></span></strong></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-ID\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Sub Course A:</span><span lang=\"EN-ID\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">  </span><span lang=\"EN-ID\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Internet of Things (IoT) for Smart City Applications during the Pandemic.</span><span lang=\"EN-ID\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"> </span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-ID\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Sub Course B: Cognitive Ergonomics: Fundamentals &amp; Applications.</span><span lang=\"EN-ID\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"> </span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-ID\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"> </span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-ID\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">7 – 18 February 2022 - Starts at 03.00 PM (GMT +7, Surabaya Zone Time).</span><span lang=\"EN-ID\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"> </span></span></strong></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-ID\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Sub Course C: Zero Waste Stores: A Way to Combat Plastics.</span><span lang=\"EN-ID\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"> </span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-ID\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Sub Course D: Exploring Indonesia Creative Design &amp; Culture.</span><span lang=\"EN-ID\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"> </span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-ID\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"> </span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-ID\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">This program is open for active students from any level and background. This program is also eligible for any staff, Faculty Staff. The fee of this program is USD 200 (USD 175 for partner universities) per person.</span><span lang=\"EN-ID\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"> </span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-ID\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"> </span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-ID\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">You may refer to our website for further information:</span><span lang=\"EN-ID\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"> </span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt;\"><span><span lang=\"EN-ID\"><a 